# Torch the Tower and Ancient Adamantoise: "If a permanent dealt damage by Torch the Tower would die this turn, exile it
# instead." The bargained Torch's 3 damage aimed at Bot1's Ornithopter is dealt to the Adamantoise instead (CR 614.9), so
# the Ornithopter was dealt no damage by it: Infernal Grasp then destroys it and it goes to the graveyard. The Adamantoise,
# already holding 17 from Fire Covenant, is dealt the 3 (20 of 20): it would die, so it is exiled instead and its "when this
# creature dies" trigger never happens - no Treasures.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Show and Tell
Ancient Adamantoise
Ornithopter
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Fire Covenant
Island
Torch the Tower
Infernal Grasp
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ancient Adamantoise)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Fire Covenant.Cast(X: 17)
Bot2.Divide(Ancient Adamantoise: 17)
Bot2.PayCost
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ancient Adamantoise.Damage = 17
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Torch the Tower.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Modes(Bargain:)
Bot2.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot2.Choose(Mox Ruby)
Bot2.Arrange( | Island)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Infernal Grasp.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile = Ancient Adamantoise
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Show and Tell; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot2.Life = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Infernal Grasp; Torch the Tower; Mox Ruby; Fire Covenant; Black Lotus
